OL,3,GNEWSABurst main interrupts water
OL,4,Asupplies in Ayrshire town for two days
OL,5,
OL,6,FA burst main has led to water supplies
OL,7,Fbeing interrupted for two days in an
OL,8,FAyrshire town.
OL,10,FSupply issues were reported in
OL,11,FKilwinning on Saturday morning, and
OL,12,FScottish Water worked through the night
OL,13,Fto repair the burst main.
OL,15,FIt said "significant progress" had been
OL,16,Fmade, but the repair was more complex
OL,17,Fwith a "potential secondary" issue
OL,18,Faffecting a valve.
OL,23,APub: 18-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,430,420,260,160,0,100
