OL,3,GNEWSABurst main interrupts water
OL,4,Asupplies in Ayrshire town for two days
OL,5,
OL,6,FScottish Water said it was not possible
OL,7,Fto say when supplies would fully
OL,8,Fresume, with tankers being used to
OL,9,Fbring in extra water and a bottled
OL,10,Fwater collection point at Kilwinning
OL,11,FAcademy.
